Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.85,Hook,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see any of it.\NJust catch me up.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.00,0:00:08.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,One prompt.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.00,0:00:12.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,It finds the connected browser.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then opens Instagram through the browser target.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.00,0:00:21.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,The existing session is already logged in.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.83,0:00:23.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,It starts collecting the feed.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.33,0:00:28.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Instagram virtualizes the feed.\NThe agent changes strategy.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.67,0:00:33.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,It switches from recommendations\Nto the Following feed.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.67,0:00:38.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then it works through the page.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.00,0:00:45.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Following feed found: 4 posts.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.00,0:00:57.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,It collects post details\Nand checks active stories.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.81,0:01:05.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,A quick pass checks the broader feed\Nfor anything else worth surfacing.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.95,0:01:10.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then it checks notifications.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.95,0:01:15.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Got everything. Close the panel. Clean up.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.35,0:01:20.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Six minutes of browsing become\Na short, structured catch-up.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.40,0:01:25.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Catch up without looking at the feed.
